urchase Clock of Destiny (2,030 gold) as item 3 in the Jungle HP Burn build for Hylos.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/hylos#build-jungle-hp-burn\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Thunder Belt\",\"text\":\"Purchase Thunder Belt (1,820 gold) as item 4 in the Jungle HP Burn build for Hylos.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/hylos#build-jungle-hp-burn\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Dominance Ice\",\"text\":\"Purchase Dominance Ice (2,010 gold) as item 5 in the Jungle HP Burn build for Hylos.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/hylos#build-jungle-hp-burn\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Guardian Helmet\",\"text\":\"Purchase Guardian Helmet (2,500 gold) as item 6 in the Jungle HP Burn build for Hylos.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/hylos#build-jungle-hp-burn\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/hylos\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-18T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5f:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n60:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":49,\"name\":\"Hylos\",\"slug\":\"hylos\",\"title\":\"Grand Warden\",\"role\":[\"Tank\"],\"specialty\":[\"Guard\",\"Initiator\"],\"lane\":[\"Roam\"],\"tier\":\"C\",\"difficulty\":2,\"releaseYear\":2017,\"stats\":{\"durability\":100,\"offense\":20,\"controlEffect\":80,\"difficulty\":50},\"winRate\":48.94,\"pickRate\":0.3,\"banRate\":0.27,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"layla\",\"heroName\":\"Layla\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Hylos is strong against heroes without mobility skills that can't easily escape his 2nd Skill, like Layla and Gord.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"gord\",\"heroName\":\"Gord\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Hylos is strong against heroes without mobility skills that can't easily escape his 2nd Skill, like Layla and Gord.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"karrie\",\"heroName\":\"Karrie\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Hylos is countered by high mobility heroes like Karrie and Lesley, as they are hard for him to lock down and can also take him out.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"lesley\",\"heroName\":\"Lesley\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Hylos is countered by high mobility heroes like Karrie and Lesley, as they are hard for him to lock down and can also take him out.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_bcc177e4f62634fca493732e4058c626.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_195ad9af866afaab415ae23a6be13b45.png\",\"officialMatchups\":[{\"kind\":\"best_ally\",\"heroId\":\"44\",\"heroName\":\"Grock\",\"heroSlug\":\"grock\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_47c9a9a373919fd9cc0c68ff7788b32a.png\",\"tip\":\"Hylos’ ultimate provides teammates with a huge speed increase, allowing heroes without displacement skills to close in on enemies.\"},{\"kind\":\"counters\",\"heroId\":\"39\",\"heroName\":\"Roger\",\"heroSlug\":\"roger\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_d2f1ce4289d7399177b7f8a25bdf593d.png\",\"tip\":\"Hylos’ control skills are an assassin’s greatest nemesis.\"},{\"kind\":\"countered_by\",\"heroId\":\"48\",\"heroName\":\"Diggie\",\"heroSlug\":\"diggie\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_84b30de71c6315ecc936a8b4d5076efc.png\",\"tip\":\"Diggie can help teammates survive through Hylos’ control effects.\"}],\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Thickened Blood\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Hylos gains 1 extra Max Mana for every 2.5 Extra Max HP gained.\\nWhen out of Mana, he can consume HP to cast skills.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Hylos gains 1 extra Max Mana for every 2.5 Extra Max HP gained.\\nWhen out of Mana, he can consume HP to cast skills.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_81f19961357acccd7005193849dc05ac.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\"]},{\"name\":\"Law and Order\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Hylos gains 50% Movement Speed and causes his next Basic Attack within 3s to deal 300 (+80% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to the target, knocking back and stunning them for 1s.\\n\\nThe extra Movement Speed rapidly decays over the duration and vanishes after the next Basic Attack.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Hylos gains 50% Movement Speed and causes his next Basic Attack within 3s to deal 300\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+80% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to the target, knocking back and stunning them for 1s.\\n\\nThe extra Movement Speed rapidly decays over the duration and vanishes after the next Basic Attack.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"12s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_6dc51b5af13742c8a0fb9e0dd1d0cb93.png\",\"tags\":[\"CC\",\"Damage\"]},{\"name\":\"Ring of Punishment\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Hylos releases the Ring of Punishment, dealing 100 (+20% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to nearby enemies per second while slowing them by 4% and reducing their Attack Speed by 7.5% for 2.5s (up to 8 stacks). Each stack also increases the enemy's damage taken from the Ring of Punishment by 5%. The Ring of Punishment consumes 30 Mana per second when it's active.\\n\\nUse Again: Hylos cancels the Ring of Punishment.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Hylos releases the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Ring of Punishment\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", dealing 100\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+20% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to nearby enemies per second while slowing them by 4% and reducing their Attack Speed by 7.5% for 2.5s (up to 8 stacks). Each stack also increases the enemy's damage taken from the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Ring of Punishment\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" by 5%. The \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Ring of Punishment\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" consumes 30 Mana per second when it's active.\\n\\n\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Use Again\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\": Hylos cancels the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Ring of Punishment\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\".\"}],\"cooldown\":\"1s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_068a1e4a7a26457bba3aadb5b7b3e675.png\",\"tags\":[\"AOE\",\"Debuff\"]},{\"name\":\"Glorious Pathway\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Hylos creates a huge pathway in the target direction, reducing enemies' Movement Speed by 75% for 1s. The pathway lasts 6s.\\nWhen on the pathway, Hylos gains Slow Immunity and recovers 3% Max HP per second. Allied heroes moving along the pathway gain 60% extra Movement Speed, while enemy heroes on the pathway will be slowed by 25%.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Hylos creates a huge pathway in the target direction, reducing enemies' Movement Speed by 75% for 1s. The pathway lasts 6s.\\nWhen on the pathway, Hylos gains Slow Immunity and recovers 3% Max HP per second. Allied heroes moving along the pathway gain 60% extra Movement Speed, while enemy heroes on the pathway will be slowed by 25%.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"40s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_fb95da3d348806ddefba457bafd30e9f.png\",\"tags\":[\"Speed Up\",\"Heal\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-2-1\",\"skillPriorityTip\":\"Max S2,then S1.\\nHealing Spell - When in danger use it to heal self and kill the enemy\",\"skillPriorityTipRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Max S2,then S1.\"},{\"type\":\"lineBreak\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Healing Spell - When in danger use it to heal self and kill the enemy\"}]},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"terizla\",\"heroName\":\"Terizla\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Hylos works best with heroes that need faster Movement Speed to engage,\\nsuch as Terizla and Minsitthar.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"minsitthar\",\"heroName\":\"Minsitthar\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Hylos works best with heroes that need faster Movement Speed to engage,\\nsuch as Terizla and Minsitthar.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In teamfights, use Hylos' Ultimate to create a pathway into the enemy team\\r\\nand then his 1st Skill to get in and stun an enemy. At the same time, use his 2nd Skill and Basic Attacks to deal continuous damage.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":4930,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_fb95da3d348806ddefba457bafd30e9f.png\"},{\"skillId\":4910,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_6dc51b5af13742c8a0fb9e0dd1d0cb93.png\"},{\"skillId\":4920,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_068a1e4a7a26457bba3aadb5b7b3e675.png\"},{\"skillId\":4900,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In the laning phase, Hylos should use his 1st Skill to get close and stun the enemy, then follow up with his 2nd Skill and Basic Attacks to deal damage.\\r\\n\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":4910,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_6dc51b5af13742c8a0fb9e0dd1d0cb93.png\"},{\"skillId\":4920,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_068a1e4a7a26457bba3aadb5b7b3e675.png\"},{\"skillId\":4900,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Hylos build, counter, and strategy guide for Mobile Legends. Cursed Helmet spike, Ring of Punishment positioning, non-obvious matchups, and when not to pick.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Hylos is not a tank in the classical engage sense. He is a mobile wall that trades Tigreal-style catch potential for the one thing no other tank can replicate: the ability to out-sustain a 5v1 and drag your squishies wherever they need to be. Pick him when your draft is built around that sustain, not around his ultimate.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"hylos\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-05-13\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"roam-mana-wall\",\"name\":\"Roam Mana Wall\",\"roleContext\":\"Roam\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\",\"cost\":700,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"clock-of-destiny\",\"name\":\"Clock of Destiny\",\"cost\":2030,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"cursed-helmet\",\"name\":\"Cursed Helmet\",\"cost\":1910,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\",\"cost\":2010,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\",\"cost\":1860,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"clock-of-destiny\",\"name\":\"Clock of Destiny\"},{\"slug\":\"cursed-helmet\",\"name\":\"Cursed Helmet\"},{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"tank\",\"name\":\"Tank Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"vitality\",\"name\":\"Vitality\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/vitality.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"tenacity\",\"name\":\"Tenacity\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/tenacity.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"concussive-blast\",\"name\":\"Concussive Blast\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/concussive-blast.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"vengeance\",\"name\":\"Vengeance\"},\"blessing\":{\"slug\":\"encourage\",\"name\":\"Encourage\"},\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"guardian-helmet\",\"name\":\"Guardian Helmet\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when repeated siege resets matter more than amplifying Glorious Pathway's self-heal.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"radiant-armor\",\"name\":\"Radiant Armor\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against repeated magic ticks that keep hitting Hylos after he walks through the first control chain.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"antique-cuirass\",\"name\":\"Antique Cuirass\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when physical skill burst is deleting Hylos before his Vengeance window finishes.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"conceal\",\"name\":\"Conceal\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"encourage\",\"name\":\"Encourage\"},\"trigger\":\"Use as the roam blessing when your team needs hidden Pathway angles instead of grouped stat sharing.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default roam setup that converts Clock's mana into extra HP, then uses aura damage and Dominance Ice to hold front-to-back fights.\",\"totalCost\":10630,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"magicpower\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPower\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":45,\"sources\":[\"Clock of Destiny\"]},{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":3250,\"sources\":[\"Clock of Destiny\",\"Cursed Helmet\",\"Oracle\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"physdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\